{
  "_comment": [
    "Special moves and special guards as data (docs/gameplay/16_SKILLS_AND_PLAYS.md §6; src/core/game/systems/special_moves.h).",
    "A new move is a new entry: its name (a text.json key), its play, three shows and its damage.",
    "use: ultimate (a weapon's, when the super charge is full), guard (a monster's move names it: moves.json guardPlay).",
    "play.kind: shape (trace the shape shown), slice (the sword's prompts: cues), bow (aim `points` moving targets),",
    "  mash (tap `points` times); timeMs: a shape's or a mash's time; size / cornerRadius: a shape on the screen.",
    "demo: before the play; step: at each step done (at the step's place); finish: after the play.",
    "A beat: at (ms), do: pathFx (particles along the shape, `corner` at each corner) fx (on player / monster, else at the",
    "  step) dim countdown banner (text) name namePart (the name a step's share at a time) count (3/5) camera (zoom, on",
    "  player / monster, ms) clip (the player's clip) hits (count x gapMs: the move's damage over them) shake sound.",
    "damage: times a normal attack (the owner: N = 10 to start), times the share of the play done (Q45)."
  ],
